# Portfolio Attribution

When the user asks for portfolio attribution, performance attribution, active
return sources, Brinson-Fachler analysis, or factor contributions, read
`.cursor/skills/portfolio-attribution/SKILL.md` and follow its workflow.

Read `.cursor/skills/portfolio-attribution/references/methodology.md` before
interpreting formulas or changing attribution assumptions. Use
`.cursor/skills/portfolio-attribution/scripts/attribution.py` for deterministic
calculations. Preserve the built-in identity checks, disclose input and
benchmark assumptions, and do not turn historical attribution into investment
advice or promised performance.
